SDL 3.4.14 (Zlib): the opengpu renderer for AmigaOS 3.x, SDL3.module's. AmigaChrome Team, 2026.
build.sh starts it as a copy of SDL's software renderer
(src/render/software/SDL_render_sw.c at src/render/opengpu/SDL_render_opengpu.c);
this patch turns that copy into the renderer, which sends SDL's drawing to
OpenGPU (stream v1.7) where OpenGPU can do it. It puts the renderer in SDL's
list before the software one, and has it take lines as lines.

